              "source": "$$\n\\lim_\\mathcal{I} M\n=\n\\{\n(m_i)_{i\\in I} \\in \\prod\\nolimits_{i\\in I} M_i\n\\mid\n\\forall \\phi : i \\to i' \\text{ in }\\mathcal{I},\nM(\\phi)(m_i) = m_{i'}\n\\}.\n$$",
